ion\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">04.睡觉记忆</div>\n    <div class=\"section-body\">\n      睡前30分钟再复习背诵的内容。睡醒后10分钟，再看关键词进行复述，并默写出来\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-bar\">\n    <div class=\"avatar-placeholder\">[头像:<br>卡通人物]</div>\n    <div class=\"bottom-text\">这样背书，就像用了魔法，过目不忘</div>\n    <div class=\"play-btn\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-id\">小红书号：4141895475</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
